{"event":"pre-tool-use","timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:50:57.051Z","tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd 'D:/Dev/senior-full-stack-with-unity-ai-code-challenge/.claude/worktrees/stratus-field-link-exercise-07ba02' && U=unity/StratusFieldLink/Assets/StratusFieldLink && git add $U/Runtime/Net/PublishService.cs $U/Tests/PlayMode/PublishFlowTests.cs && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(unity): persist and retry 4xx like 5xx (3 retries, then hold); 409 holds at once\n\nA rejected sketch is still reported to the foreman with the server's reason,\nbut is now kept on the tablet, retried up to MaxRetries and then held instead\nof being dropped. A 409 is kept but held immediately and never auto-resent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2","description":"Commit the 4xx persistence change"}}
